###  https://www.michaeldebellis.com/supply_chain_model/baseModelMetadata
<https://www.michaeldebellis.com/supply_chain_model/baseModelMetadata> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                                                       <https://w3id.org/sulo/contains> <https://www.michaeldebellis.com/supply_chain_model/baseModelMetadata> ;
                                                                       <https://w3id.org/sulo/hasPart> <https://www.michaeldebellis.com/supply_chain_model/baseModelMetadata> ;
                                                                       <https://w3id.org/sulo/isIn> <https://www.michaeldebellis.com/supply_chain_model/baseModelMetadata> ;
                                                                       <https://w3id.org/sulo/isPartOf> <https://www.michaeldebellis.com/supply_chain_model/baseModelMetadata> ;
                                                                       <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-10-22"^^xsd:date ;
                                                                       <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8824-9577> ;
                                                                       <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Self-contained experimental merge of Bro_Pro (Big_Bro/SULO, a PROV-O subset and P-Plan) with OWL-Time. Seven direct-date SWRL rules derive all thirteen Allen base relations using the retained inverse axioms; one additional SWRL rule propagates qualified PROV associations. No catalog or owl:imports resolution is required."@en ;
                                                                       <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-10-22"^^xsd:date ;
                                                                       <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://www.michaeldebellis.com/process_model/mergedSourceMetadata> ;
                                                                       <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Process model: Bro_Pro with OWL-Time and Allen interval rules"@en ;
                                                                       rdfs:comment "Temporal rule contract: each interval needs one unambiguous beginning and end, each represented by an instant with a timezone-qualified xsd:dateTimeStamp value using time:inXSDDateTimeStamp. Rules require positive duration and complete timestamps; they do not reason over uncertain or undated endpoints. Allen equality does not imply owl:sameAs. PROV literal start/end properties alone do not supply these endpoint paths. SULO temporal quantities have not been equated with OWL-Time entities. Legacy named temporal examples are retained."@en ,
                                                                                    "Unchanged header annotations from the corrected reusable process_model base used for this extension. The base source file is a separate deliverable."@en ;
                                                                       rdfs:label "Process model"@en ;
                                                                       owl:versionInfo "experimental-base-sync-2026-10-22" ;
                                                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "2026-10-22 review: verified the original six enabled rules against the published W3C Time With SWRL Rules V2.ttl. Retained direct endpoint comparison; changed the before head to intervalBefore; completed finishes/finishedBy; used value comparisons for equal boundaries; guarded against zero/reversed durations. Fixed the January gMonth literal. Restored Bundle-to-Entity and qualified-association typing, corrected the agent domain to AgentInfluence, and added the SWRL equivalent of the PROV association chain. Retained the original header at pm:mergedSourceMetadata. P-Plan and SULO logical axioms and existing test individuals are otherwise unchanged."@en ,
                                                                                                                        "2026-10-22 — Changed by ChatGPT. Synchronized the reusable process_model base with the later corrections in bro_pro_corrected.ttl before creating any domain-specific extension. Restored both prov:hadRole domains: prov:Influence and the union of prov:Association with prov:InstantaneousEvent. Restored prov:EmptyCollection as an owl:Class and subclass of prov:Collection, and prov:Collection as an owl:Class and subclass of prov:Entity, retaining the existing named-individual declaration for prov:EmptyCollection. Copied the corresponding PROV labels, definitions and source annotations, including the additional annotations on AgentInfluence, Association and Bundle. Verified that the earlier association repairs, seven direct-date Allen SWRL rules, qualified-association rule and January datatype correction were already present; preserved all eight rule bodies without duplication. Retained the ontology IRI, P-Plan and SULO definitions, all existing example individuals and dates, and earlier ontology metadata. No supply-chain vocabulary, test fixtures or inferred assertions were added."@en .


