   rdfs:comment "Allen interval relation: a.start < b.start < a.end < b.end. Compares time:inXSDDateTimeStamp values directly; both intervals must have beginning/end timestamps with start < end. Equal timestamps may belong to distinct instant individuals. No instant-to-instant ordering is materialized. Inverse relations are supplied by the retained OWL-Time inverse-property axioms."@en ;
   rdfs:label "IntervalOverlaps_DirectDates" ;
   rdf:type <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#Imp> ;
